---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="SEO & Search Engine Optimization – Sustainable Rankings | Valorferrum"
  description="SEO freelancer for technical optimization, content strategy & sustainable rankings. Onpage, offpage, local SEO & e-commerce. For SMEs, startups & NGOs."
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-spectrum-purple/8 rounded-full blur-[120px] pulse-anim"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-spectrum-blue/6 rounded-full blur-[100px] float-anim"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <div class="reveal mb-4">
        <a href="/en/services/" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 group">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:-translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          All Services
        </a>
      </div>

      <h1 class="reveal font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        SEO & Search Engine Optimization
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        Technical, content-driven and strategic. No quick-fix marketing,
        but solid work that sticks with Google.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== THE FOUR PILLARS ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6" aria-labelledby="pillars-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="pillars-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Technical SEO, Content & Onpage Optimization
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Search engine optimization is not a single measure, but an interplay.
          I work on all pillars that sustainably improve your ranking.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Technical SEO -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Technical SEO</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The foundation decides. Without clean technology, content cannot work.
            I optimize everything Google sees – before users see it.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Core Web Vitals & load time optimization</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Crawl budget, indexing & canonicals</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Schema.org, hreflang & mobile-first</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Content Strategy -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-pink/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Content Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Content that not only ranks, but convinces. I find the questions
            your target audience really has – and answer them better than the competition.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Keyword research & topic clusters</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Content gaps & competitive analysis</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>E-E-A-T: Expertise, Authority, Trust</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Onpage Optimization -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16m-7 6h7"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Onpage Optimization</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Every element on your page sends signals to Google.
            I make sure these signals are clear, consistent and keyword-relevant.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Meta titles, descriptions & header hierarchy</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Internal linking & keyword density</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Image SEO, ALT tags & structured data</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Offpage SEO -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-yellow/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Offpage SEO</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Google trusts pages that other trustworthy pages link to.
            I build authority – sustainably, not manipulatively.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Link building & backlink analysis</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Digital PR & brand mentions</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Social signals & online reputation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CONCRETE MEASURES ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="measures-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="measures-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Concrete SEO Measures for Sustainable Rankings
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          No black hat, no tricks. I implement proven methods that work long-term –
          and stick to Google's guidelines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- E-E-A-T -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary text-center mb-3">E-E-A-T</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">
            Expertise, Experience, Authority and Trust. I optimize your content and your profile so that Google and users see you as a credible source – not as generic filler content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Meta Data & Headers -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 8h10M7 12h4m1 8l-4-4H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-3l-4 4z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary text-center mb-3">Meta Data & Headers</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">
            Every page needs a clear hierarchy. I write titles and descriptions that both Google and users understand – concise, relevant and click-worthy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Keyword Density & Relevance -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary text-center mb-3">Keyword Density & Relevance</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">
            Not too little, not too much. I balance keywords naturally in texts and headings – so that content reads well for humans and ranks well for Google.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Link Building -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary text-center mb-3">Link Building</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">
            Quality over quantity. I identify relevant sources, build relationships and generate backlinks that actually strengthen your domain – not just inflate a number.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Foundation -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary text-center mb-3">Technical Foundation</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">
            Fix crawl errors, reduce load times, implement schema markup. The invisible work that makes the difference between ranking and being ignored.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Local SEO -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary text-center mb-3">Local SEO</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm text-center leading-relaxed">
            Optimize Google Business Profile, ensure NAP consistency, improve local pack visibility. For businesses that want to be found in their region.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== SEO KPIs ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6" aria-labelledby="kpis-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="kpis-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          SEO KPIs & Performance Measurement
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          SEO is not a black box. I measure transparently which measures have which effect – and adjust the strategy based on data, not gut feeling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Organic Traffic -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">01</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Organic Traffic</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The most important metric: How many users find you via Google & Co. – and how does that develop over time? Not snapshots, but trends.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Keyword Rankings -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-pink/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-spectrum-pink mb-3">02</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Keyword Rankings</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Where do you stand for your target keywords? I track not just position 1, but the development of the entire keyword set – including longtail opportunities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Web Vitals -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-spectrum-blue mb-3">03</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Core Web Vitals</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Load time, interactivity and visual stability. Google's official ranking factor – and decisive for whether visitors stay or bounce.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Conversion Rate -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-yellow/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-spectrum-yellow mb-3">04</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Conversion Rate</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Traffic is just the beginning. I measure how many visitors become customers, leads or inquiries – and optimize the entire funnel, not just the entry page.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Click-Through Rate -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">05</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Click-Through Rate</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            How often is clicked when your page appears in search results? An indicator of the relevance and attractiveness of your snippets – optimizable through meta data.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Backlink Profile -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-pink/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-spectrum-pink mb-3">06</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Backlink Profile</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Quality and quantity of referring domains. A stronger link profile means more trust and better rankings – but only if the links come from relevant sources.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== SEO PROCESS ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="process-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-gradient-radial from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="process-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          SEO Process: From Analysis to Ranking
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Sustainable SEO takes time – but no time without a plan. Every step is comprehensible and measurable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 items-start">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-primary">1</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">SEO Audit & Status Quo</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Technical analysis, competitive research and keyword potential. Where do you stand – and where are the biggest quick wins? I look at your site the way Google does: without assumptions, with data.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 items-start" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-spectrum-pink">2</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Strategy & Roadmap</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Prioritization of measures, content planning and technical roadmap. No quick shot, but a plan that works – prioritized by effort and impact.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 items-start" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-spectrum-blue">3</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Implementation, Monitoring & Iteration</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              I implement, measure results and adjust the strategy. Regular reporting shows which measures work – and where we need to pivot. SEO is not a one-off project, but continuous optimization.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CTA ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="reveal font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">
        Better Rankings Start with an Audit
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal text-text-secondary text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        Whether technical audit, content strategy or complete SEO management: Let's talk in a free initial consultation about where your biggest leverage lies.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="px-8 py-4 bg-primary text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 hover:shadow-primary/30 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          Free Initial Consultation
        </a>
        <a href="/en/pricing/" class="px-8 py-4 bg-surface border border-border text-text-primary font-semibold rounded-xl hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300">
          Prices & Packages
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>